msgstr "Tarkastele ja analysoi tilausten ja istuntojen tilastotietoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:60
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Point of Sale tutorials <https://www.odoo.com/slides/point-"
