msgid ""
"**Restaurants**: Customers can be served at their :guilabel:`Table` or at "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup zone`."
msgstr ""
"**Ravintolat**: Asiakkaat voidaan palvella kohteessa :guilabel:`Pöytä` "
"tai :guilabel:`Noutoalue`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:104
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Table` service, they can pay after their :guilabel:`Meal` or "
"after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"Palvelussa :guilabel:`Pöytä` he voivat maksaa valinnan :guilabel:`Ateria` "
"tai :guilabel:`Jokainen tilaus` jälkeen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:106
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Pickup zone` service, they can only pay after :guilabel:`Each "
"order`."
msgstr ""
"Palvelussa :guilabel:`Noutoalue` he voivat maksaa vain "
"valinnan :guilabel:`Jokainen tilaus` jälkeen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Shops**: Customers can only be served at the :guilabel:`Pickup zone` and "
"pay after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"**Kaupat**: Asiakkaat voidaan palvella vain kohteessa :guilabel:`Noutoalue`, "
"ja he maksavat valinnan :guilabel:`Jokainen tilaus` jälkeen."

