"Customers can pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>` or "
"using any configured :doc:`payment method <../payment_methods>`. If "
"the :guilabel:`Online Payment` field is left empty, customers pay at the "
"cashier."
msgstr ""
"Asiakkaat voivat maksaa :doc:`verkossa </applications/finance/"
"payment_providers>` tai käyttämällä mitä tahansa "
"määritettyä :doc:`maksutapaa <payment_methods>`. Jos "
"kenttä :guilabel:`Verkkomaksu` jätetään tyhjäksi, asiakkaat maksavat "
"kassalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:116
msgid ""
"Customers can be served at their :guilabel:`Table` or at "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup zone`, but they must pay after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"Asiakkaat voidaan palvella kohteessa :guilabel:`Pöytä` "
"tai :guilabel:`Noutoalue`, mutta heidän on maksettava "
"valinnan :guilabel:`Jokainen tilaus` jälkeen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:118
msgid ""
"Payment via a terminal is only possible with :doc:`Adyen <../payment_methods/"
"terminals/adyen>`, :doc:`Stripe <../payment_methods/terminals/stripe>`, "
"or :doc:`Viva.com <../payment_methods/terminals/viva_com>` terminals."
msgstr ""
"Maksupäätteellä maksaminen on mahdollista vain :doc:`Adyen <../"
"payment_methods/terminals/adyen>`-, :doc:`Stripe <../payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>`- tai :doc:`Viva.com <../payment_methods/terminals/"
"viva_com>`-päätteillä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:122
msgid ""
"To pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>`, customers "
"must scan the displayed QR code."
msgstr ""
"Maksaakseen :doc:`verkossa </applications/finance/payment_providers>` "
"asiakkaiden on skannattava näytöllä näkyvä QR-koodi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Cash` payments are not supported."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Käteinen`-maksuja ei tueta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:127
