":doc:`Viivakoodinlukijan käyttöönotto <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/"
"hardware>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:103
msgid ""
":doc:`Activate barcode scanners <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/"
