msgstr ""
":doc:`Viivakoodinlukijoiden aktivointi <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/"
"setup/software>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:106
msgid "Assign barcodes"
msgstr "Määritä viivakoodit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:108
msgid ""
"To use this feature, :ref:`assign a barcode to your products <inventory/"
"barcode/set-barcodes>` following the :doc:`default barcode nomenclature "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>`. You can also assign "
"barcodes automatically  using the :doc:`barcode lookup feature and database "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."
msgstr ""
"Käyttääksesi tätä toimintoa :ref:`määritä viivakoodit tuotteillesi "
"<inventory/barcode/set-barcodes>` noudattaen :doc:`oletusarvoista "
"viivakoodinimikkeistöä <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/software>`. "
"Voit myös määrittää viivakoodeja automaattisesti "
"käyttämällä :doc:`viivakoodin hakutoimintoa ja tietokantaa </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:114
msgid ""
"Employees can :ref:`log into the POS by scanning a badge <pos/employee-login/"
"user-login>`. To configure this feature, open the **Employees** app, select "
"an employee, then, in the :guilabel:`HR Settings` tab, fill in "
"the :guilabel:`PIN Code` or :guilabel:`Badge ID`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:121
msgid "Discount tags"
msgstr "Alennustagit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:123
msgid ""
"Discount tags are specific barcodes used to apply a percentage discount to a "
"product. They follow a specific discount nomenclature that allows the POS to "
"recognize the barcode as a price reduction rather than a new product. These "
"are commonly used for items nearing their :doc:`expiration date </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"expiration_dates>`."
msgstr ""
"Alennustagit ovat erityisiä viivakoodeja, joita käytetään "
"prosenttialennuksen soveltamiseen tuotteeseen. Ne noudattavat tiettyä "
"alennus-nimikkeistöä, jonka avulla kassajärjestelmä tunnistaa viivakoodin "
"hinnan alennukseksi eikä uudeksi tuotteeksi. Niitä käytetään yleisesti "
"tuotteille, jotka lähestyvät niiden :doc:`viimeistä käyttöpäivää </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"expiration_dates>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:129
msgid ""
"A carton of milk is expiring tomorrow. By scanning a barcode following the "
"discount nomenclature (e.g., a barcode starting with `2250`), Odoo "
"automatically applies the defined price reduction of 50% to the milk during "
"the current transaction."
msgstr ""
"Maitotölkki vanhenee huomenna. Skannaamalla alennus-nimikkeistöä noudattavan "
"viivakoodin (esim. viivakoodin, joka alkaa `2250`), Odoo soveltaa "
"automaattisesti määritetyn 50 % hinnan alennuksen maitoon nykyisen "
"tapahtuman aikana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:134
msgid "Barcode nomenclature"
msgstr "Viivakoodi-nimikkeistö"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:136
msgid ""
"Barcode nomenclatures explain how barcodes are identified and classified. "
"When a barcode is scanned, it is linked to the first rule that matches its "
"pattern. This pattern syntax adheres to a standardized method of prefix "
"matching; a barcode is considered a match if its prefix aligns with the "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"Viivakoodi-nimikkeistöt selittävät, miten viivakoodit tunnistetaan ja "
"luokitellaan. Kun viivakoodi skannataan, se linkitetään ensimmäiseen "
"sääntöön, joka vastaa sen mallia. Tämä mallisyntaksi noudattaa standardoitua "
"etuliitetäsmäytyksen menetelmää; viivakoodin katsotaan vastaavan, jos sen "
"etuliite on linjassa mallin kanssa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:141
msgid ""
"Patterns also define how numerical values —such as weight, price, or "
"percentage— are encoded into the barcode. These are indicated by `{NNN}`, "
"where the `N`'s define the position of the digits."
msgstr ""
"Mallit määrittävät myös, miten numeeriset arvot – kuten paino, hinta tai "
"prosenttiosuus – koodataan viivakoodiin. Nämä merkitään `{NNN}`, jossa `N`:t "
"määrittävät numeroiden sijainnin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:144
msgid ""
"To view or edit these rules, go to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
"settings>`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Inventory` section, and click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal Link`) icon next "
"to :guilabel:`Barcode Nomenclature`."
msgstr ""
"Nähdäksesi tai muokataksesi näitä sääntöjä, siirry :ref:`kassajärjestelmän "
"asetuksiin <pos/use/settings>`, vieritä :guilabel:`Varastointi` -osioon ja "
"napsauta :icon:`oi-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Sisäinen linkki`) -kuvaketta "
"kohdan :guilabel:`Viivakoodi-nimikkeistö` vieressä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:148
msgid ""
"For discount tags, use the :guilabel:`Discount Barcodes` rule. The default "
"pattern is :guilabel:`22{NN}`, meaning the barcode must start with `22`, "
"followed by two digits representing the discount percentage."
msgstr ""
"Alennustagia varten käytä :guilabel:`Alennusviivakoodit` -sääntöä. "
"Oletusmalli on :guilabel:`22{NN}`, mikä tarkoittaa, että viivakoodin on "
"alettava `22`, jota seuraa kaksi numeroa, jotka edustavat alennusprosenttia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:152
msgid "discount tags nomenclature setting form"
msgstr "alennustagien nimikkeistöasetusten lomake"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:157
msgid ""
"To allow for three-digit discounts (such as `100%`), add an extra `N` to "
"the :guilabel:`Barcode Pattern` field (e.g., `22{NNN}`)."
msgstr ""
"Kolminumeroisten alennusten (kuten `100%`) sallimiseksi lisää ylimääräinen "
"`N` :guilabel:`Viivakoodimalli` -kenttään (esim. `22{NNN}`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:161
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/"
"barcode_nomenclature`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/"
"barcode_nomenclature`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:166
msgid ""
"To use discount tags, scan the product barcode or manually add it to the "
"cart. Then, scan the discount tag. The discount is automatically applied to "
"the last product added to the cart."
msgstr ""
"Alennustagien käyttämiseksi skannaa tuotteen viivakoodi tai lisää se "
"manuaalisesti ostoskoriin. Skannaa sitten alennustagi. Alennus sovelletaan "
"automaattisesti viimeiseen ostoskoriin lisättyyn tuotteeseen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo Point of Sale allows for the :ref:`creation <pos/use/create-pos>` "
"and :ref:`configuration <pos/use/settings>` of a point of sale as well as "
"the management of typical daily operations. These include :ref:`opening the "
"POS register <pos/use/open-register>` and :ref:`processing sales "
"transactions <pos/use/sell>`, :ref:`registering and assigning customers <pos/"
"use/customers>`, :ref:`handling returns and refunds <pos/use/"
"refund>`, :ref:`managing the cash register <pos/use/cash-register>`, "
"and :ref:`closing the POS register <pos/use/register-close>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-kassajärjestelmä mahdollistaa kassajärjestelmän :ref:`luomisen <pos/use/"
"create-pos>` ja :ref:`määrittämisen <pos/use/settings>` sekä tyypillisten "
"päivittäisten toimintojen hallinnan. Näitä ovat :ref:`kassakoneen avaaminen "
"<pos/use/open-register>` ja :ref:`myyntitapahtumien käsittely <pos/use/"
"sell>`, :ref:`asiakkaiden rekisteröinti ja määrittäminen <pos/use/"
"customers>`, :ref:`palautusten ja hyvitysten käsittely <pos/use/"
"refund>`, :ref:`kassakoneen hallinta <pos/use/cash-register>` "
"ja :ref:`kassakoneen sulkeminen <pos/use/register-close>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:16
msgid ":doc:`use/pos_invoices`"
msgstr ":doc:`use/pos_invoices`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:21
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Point of Sale app provides access rights levels that determine which "
"actions a user can perform. Grant specific access levels to waiters, "
"managers, and other POS employees to protect sensitive data and align "
"permissions with daily employee responsibilities. The access rights levels "
"work as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Employee** (without a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>` "
"or :ref:`with a light database user <access-rights/roles>`): Employees can "
"perform POS actions based on the access level :doc:`granted in the POS "
"settings <extra/employee_login>`. Employees can "
"have :guilabel:`Supervised`, :guilabel:`Restrictive`, :guilabel:`Cashier`, "
"or :guilabel:`Manager` access rights, with each level providing more access "
"to the POS register. Employees without a linked database user or with a "
"linked light user can use the POS register only after a database user opens "
"the POS register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Employee** (with a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>`): Employees "
"with a database user have the same access rights as employees without a "
"database user or employees with a light database user, unless they have been "
"added to the :guilabel:`User` :ref:`access group <access-rights/user-"
"permissions>` of the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` app. The :guilabel:`User` "
"access group grants access to most POS features, including parts of the POS "
"backend (such as the :guilabel:`Dashboard`, :guilabel:`Orders`, "
"and :guilabel:`Products` menus), and allows users to open, close, and "
"operate the POS register. To restrict the POS register access of an employee "
"who is part of the :guilabel:`User` access group, add the employee to the "
"appropriate :doc:`employee group <extra/employee_login>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Manager**: A manager is a :doc:`database user <../../general/users>` who "
"has been added to the :guilabel:`Administrator` :ref:`access group <access-"
"rights/user-permissions>` of the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` app. Managers can "
"access all POS features, including the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
"settings>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:52
msgid "Create a POS"
msgstr "Luo kassajärjestelmä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:54
msgid ""
"If no point of sale exists in the database, a set of POS cards is displayed "
"on the Point of Sale :guilabel:`Dashboard`. Each card represents a business "
"type. Click a card to create a POS with preconfigured settings tailored to "
"that type. These settings can be adjusted later as needed."
msgstr ""
"Jos tietokannassa ei ole kassajärjestelmää, "
"Kassajärjestelmä-:guilabel:`Koontonäytössä` näytetään joukko kassakortteja. "
"Jokainen kortti edustaa yritystyyppiä. Napsauta korttia luodaksesi "
"kassajärjestelmän, jossa on kyseiselle tyypille räätälöidyt esimääritellyt "
"asetukset. Näitä asetuksia voidaan muuttaa myöhemmin tarpeen mukaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:58
msgid ""
"To create additional POS or to create one from scratch, go "
"to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Point of Sales`, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and type a name. Additionally, "
"click :guilabel:`Configurations > Settings` to fully configure the point of "
"sale."
msgstr ""
"Luodaksesi lisää kassajärjestelmiä tai luodaksesi sellaisen tyhjästä, siirry "
"kohtaan :menuselection:`Kassajärjestelmä --> Kokoonpano --> "
"Kassajärjestelmät`, napsauta :guilabel:`Uusi` ja kirjoita nimi. Lisäksi "
"napsauta :guilabel:`Kokoonpanot > Asetukset` määrittääksesi "
"kassajärjestelmän täysin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:63
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and click :guilabel:`+ New Shop` in the header."
msgstr ""
"Vaihtoehtoisesti siirry kohtaan :menuselection:`Kassajärjestelmä --> "
"Kokoonpano --> Asetukset` ja napsauta :guilabel:`+ Uusi myymälä` otsikossa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:67
msgid ""
"To optimize the POS app tab's performance, disable the `Memory Saver "
"<https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/12929150?hl=en#zippy=%2Cturn-"
"memory-saver-on-or-off>`_ setting in Google Chrome."
msgstr ""
"Optimoidaksesi kassajärjestelmäsovelluksen välilehden suorituskyvyn, poista "
"`Muistin säästäjä <https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/12929150?"
"hl=en#zippy=%2Cturn-memory-saver-on-or-off>`_ -asetus käytöstä Google "
"Chromessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:70
msgid ""
"Assign a dedicated :doc:`cash payment method and a cash journal <../"
"point_of_sale/payment_methods>` to each POS. This ensures that accounting "
"entries are separated and traceable to specific points of sale."
msgstr ""
"Määritä kullekin kassajärjestelmälle oma :doc:`käteismaksutapa ja "
"käteiskirjauskansio <../point_of_sale/payment_methods>`. Tämä varmistaa, "
"että kirjanpitomerkinnät erotetaan ja ne voidaan jäljittää tiettyihin "
"kassajärjestelmiin."

