"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon near the top to save."
msgstr ""
"Syötä lopuksi arvo sarakkeeseen :guilabel:`Hinta`. Tallenna klikkaamalla "
"yläreunassa olevaa :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Tallenna "
"manuaalisesti)` -kuvaketta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:205
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:223
msgid ""
"Add a date range in the :guilabel:`Validity` column. To add "
"a :guilabel:`Validity` column, click the :icon:`oi-settings-"
