msgid "Optional Products tab"
msgstr "Valinnaiset tuotteet -välilehti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:183
msgid ""
"Open the *Optional Products* tab to select related products that can be "
"presented to the customer, which may result in an increased sale."
msgstr ""
"Avaa *Valinnaiset tuotteet* -välilehti valitaksesi liittyviä tuotteita, "
"joita voidaan esitellä asiakkaalle lisämyynnin saavuttamiseksi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:186
msgid ""
"For example, if the customer wants to buy a car, an optional product that "
"could be offered is a *Trailer Hitch*."
msgstr ""
"Jos asiakas esimerkiksi haluaa ostaa auton, valinnainen tuote, jota "
"voitaisiin tarjota, on *Vetokoukku*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:190
msgid ":doc:`optional_products`"
msgstr ":doc:`optional_products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:193
msgid "Other Info tab"
msgstr "Muut tiedot -välilehti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:195
msgid ""
"In the *Other Info* tab, there are various quotation-related configurations "
"separated into four different "
"sections: :guilabel:`Sales`, :guilabel:`Delivery`, :guilabel:`Invoicing`, "
"and :guilabel:`Tracking`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Muut tiedot`-välilehdellä on erilaisia tarjoukseen liittyviä "
"määrityksiä, jotka on jaettu neljään eri "
"osioon: :guilabel:`Myynti`, :guilabel:`Toimitus`, :guilabel:`Laskutus` "
"ja :guilabel:`Seuranta`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:200
msgid ""
"Some fields **only** appear if specific settings and options have been "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Jotkin kentät näkyvät **vain**, jos tietyt asetukset ja valinnat on "
"määritetty."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:203
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:92
msgid "Sales section"
msgstr "Myynti-osio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:205
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Sales` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are sales "
"specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Myynti`-osiossa :guilabel:`Muut tiedot`-välilehdellä on myyntiin "
"liittyviä kenttiä, jotka voidaan määrittää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:208
msgid ""
"The Sales section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Tarjouslomakkeen Muut tiedot -välilehden Myynti-osio Odoon Myynnissä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Assign a salesperson from the drop-down menu to be "
"associated with this quotation. The user who originally created the "
"quotation is selected in this field by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Assign a specific sales team to this quotation. If "
"the selected :guilabel:`Salesperson` is a member of a sales team, that team "
"is auto-populated in the field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Myyntitiimi`: Liitä tähän tarjoukseen tietty myyntitiimi. Jos "
"valittu :guilabel:`Myyjä` kuuluu myyntitiimiin, kyseinen tiimi täyttyy "
"kenttään automaattisesti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:215
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select a company from the drop-down menu that this "
"quotation should be associated with. This field only appears when working in "
"a multi-company environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online signature`: Click this checkbox to request an online "
"signature from the customer to confirm the order. This field only appears if "
"the *Online Signature* setting has been enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Verkkoallekirjoitus`: Valitse tämä valintaruutu pyytääksesi "
"asiakkaalta verkkoallekirjoituksen tilauksen vahvistamiseksi. Tämä kenttä "
"näkyy vain, jos *Verkkoallekirjoitus*-asetus on otettu käyttöön."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:219
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online payment`: Click this checkbox and enter a desired "
"percentage in the adjacent field to request an online payment from the "
"customer (for that designated percentage of the total amount) to confirm the "
"order. This field only appears if the *Online Payment* setting has been "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer Reference`: Enter a custom reference ID for this "
"customer. The entered reference ID can contain letters, numbers, or a mix of "
"both."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Asiakkaan viite`: Kirjoita mukautettu viitetunnus tälle "
"asiakkaalle. Syötetty viitetunnus voi sisältää kirjaimia, numeroita tai "
"molempia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Add specific tags to the quotation for added organization "
"and enhanced searchability in the Odoo **Sales** application. Multiple tags "
"can be added, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tunnisteet`: Lisää tarjoukseen tunnisteet paremman järjestelyn ja "
"hakujen tehostamiseksi Odoon **Myynti**-sovelluksessa. Tarvittaessa voidaan "
"lisätä useita tunnisteita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:229
msgid "Delivery section"
msgstr "Toimitus-osio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:231
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Delivery` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"delivery-specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Toimitus`-osiossa :guilabel:`Muut tiedot`-välilehdellä on "
"toimitukseen liittyviä kenttiä, jotka voidaan määrittää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:234
msgid ""
"The Delivery section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Muut tiedot -välilehden Toimitus-osio tarjouslomakkeella Odoo Myynti "
"-sovelluksessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Weight`: Displays the weight of the items being shipped. "
"This field is not modifiable. Product weight is configured on individual "
"product forms."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Toimituksen paino`: Näyttää toimitettavien tuotteiden painon. "
"Tämä kenttä ei ole muokattavissa. Tuotteen paino määritetään yksittäisissä "
"tuotelomakkeissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:239
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm`: Select an Incoterm (International Commercial Term) to "
"use as predefined commercial terms for international transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm`: Valitse Incoterm (kansainvälinen toimituslauseke) "
"käytettäväksi ennalta määritettynä kauppaehtona kansainvälisissä "
"liiketoimissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:241
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm Location`: If an Incoterm is being used, enter the "
"international location in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm-sijainti`: Jos Incotermia käytetään, kirjoita "
"kansainvälinen sijainti tähän kenttään."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:243
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Policy`: Select a desired shipping policy from the drop-"
"down menu. If all products are delivered at once, the delivery order is "
"scheduled based on the greatest product lead time. Otherwise, it is based on "
"the shortest lead time. The available options are :guilabel:`As soon as "
"possible` or :guilabel:`When all products are ready`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Date`: Click into the empty field to reveal a calendar "
"popover, from which a customer delivery date can be selected. If no custom "
"date is required, refer to the :guilabel:`Expected` date listed to the right "
"of that field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Toimituspäivä`: Napsauta tyhjää kenttää avataksesi kalenterin, "
"josta voidaan valita asiakkaan toimituspäivä. Jos mukautettua päivämäärää ei "
"tarvita, katso kyseisen kentän oikealla puolella olevaa :guilabel:`Odotettu`-"
"päivämäärää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:252
msgid "Invoicing section"
msgstr "Laskutus-osio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:254
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Invoicing` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"invoicing specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Laskutus`-osiossa :guilabel:`Muut tiedot`-välilehdellä on "
"laskutukseen liittyviä kenttiä, jotka voidaan määrittää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:257
msgid ""
"The Invoicing section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr ""
"Muut tiedot -välilehden Laskutus-osio tarjouslomakkeella Odoo Myynti "
"-sovelluksessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Position`: Select a fiscal position to be used to adapt "
"taxes and accounts for particular customers or sales orders/invoices. The "
"default value comes from the customer. If a selection is made in this field, "
"an :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Update Taxes` clickable link and icon "
"appear. When clicked, the taxes for this particular customer and quotation "
"are updated. A confirmation window appears as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:265
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Account`: Select an analytic account to apply to this "
"customer/quotation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kustannuspaikka`: Valitse kustannuspaikka, jota sovelletaan tähän "
"asiakkaaseen/tarjoukseen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:268
msgid "Tracking section"
msgstr "Seuranta-osio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:270
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"tracking-specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Seuranta`-osiossa :guilabel:`Muut tiedot`-välilehdellä on "
"seurantaan liittyviä kenttiä, jotka voidaan määrittää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:273
msgid ""
"The Tracking section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Myynti-sovelluksen tarjouksen Muut tiedot -välilehden Seuranta-osio Odoo "
"Myynnissä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:276
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source Document`: Enter the reference of the document that "
"generated the quotation/sales order, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lähdeasiakirja`: Kirjoita tarjouksen/myyntitilauksen luoneen "
"asiakirjan viite, jos sovellettavissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opportunity`: Select the specific opportunity (from the **CRM** "
"app) related to this quotation, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Myyntimahdollisuus`: Valitse tähän tarjoukseen liittyvä "
"myyntimahdollisuus (**CRM**-sovelluksesta), jos sovellettavissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:280
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Select the marketing campaign related to this "
"quotation, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampanja`: Valitse tähän tarjoukseen liittyvä "
"markkinointikampanja, jos sovellettavissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Select the method by which this quotation originated "
"(e.g., *Email*), if applicable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:283
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Select the source of the link used to generate this "
"quotation (e.g., *Facebook*), if applicable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:287
msgid ":doc:`../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:290
msgid "Notes tab"
msgstr "Muistiinpanot-välilehti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:292
msgid ""
"In the *Notes* tab of the quotation form, enter any specific internal notes "
"about the quotation and customer, if desired."
msgstr ""
"Kirjoita tarjouslomakkeen *Muistiinpanot*-välilehdelle halutessasi tarjousta "
"ja asiakasta koskevia sisäisiä muistiinpanoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:298
msgid "Send and confirm a quotation"
msgstr "Lähetä ja vahvista tarjous"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:300
msgid ""
"Once all the necessary fields and tabs have been configured, it is time to "
"send the quotation to the customer for confirmation. Upon confirmation, the "
"quotation turns into an official sales order."
msgstr ""
"Kun kaikki tarvittavat kentät ja välilehdet on määritetty, on aika lähettää "
"tarjous asiakkaalle vahvistettavaksi. Vahvistuksen jälkeen tarjouksesta "
"tulee virallinen myyntitilaus."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:303
msgid "At the top of the form, there is a series of buttons:"
msgstr "Lomakkeen yläosassa on useita painikkeita:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send by Email`: When clicked, a pop-up window appears with the "
"customer's name and email address in the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, the "
"quotation (and reference ID) in the :guilabel:`Subject` field, and a brief "
"default message in the body of the email, which can be modified if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:310
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:318
msgid ""
"Below that, a PDF copy of the quotation is attached. When ready, "
"click :guilabel:`Send` to send the quotation via email to the customer so "
"they can review and confirm it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:312
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send PRO-FORMA Invoice`: This button **only** appears if the *Pro-"
"Forma Invoice* setting has been enabled. When clicked, a pop-up window "
"appears with the customer's name and email address in "
"the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, the *Proforma* invoice (and reference ID) "
"in the :guilabel:`Subject` field, and a brief default message in the body of "
"the email, which can be modified if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:320
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Confirm`: When clicked, the quotation is confirmed, and the "
"status changes to :guilabel:`Sales Order`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vahvista`: Kun painiketta napsautetaan, tarjous vahvistetaan ja "
"tila muuttuu tilaan :guilabel:`Myyntitilaus`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:322
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Preview`: When clicked, Odoo reveals a preview of the quotation "
"the customer sees when they log into their customer portal. Click "
"the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Back to edit mode` link at the top of "
"the preview page, in the blue banner, to return to the quotation form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Esikatselu`: Kun painiketta napsautetaan, Odoo näyttää "
"esikatselun tarjouksesta, jonka asiakas näkee kirjautuessaan "
"asiakasportaaliinsa. Palaa tarjouslomakkeelle napsauttamalla sivun yläosassa "
"sinisessä bannerissa olevaa :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Takaisin "
"muokkaustilaan` -linkkiä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:325
msgid ":guilabel:`Cancel`: When clicked, the quotation is canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Peruuta`: Kun painiketta napsautetaan, tarjous peruutetaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:328
msgid ""
"If the *Lock Confirmed Sales* setting is enabled, the sales order "
"becomes :guilabel:`Locked` and is indicated as such on the sales order form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:331
msgid ""
"At this point, the quotation has been confirmed, turned into a sales order, "
"and is now ready to be invoiced and paid for."
msgstr ""
"Tässä vaiheessa tarjous on vahvistettu, muutettu myyntitilaukseksi ja on nyt "
"valmis laskutettavaksi ja maksettavaksi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:334
msgid ""
"For more information about invoicing, refer to :doc:`Invoice based on "
"delivered or ordered quantities <../invoicing/invoicing_policy>`."
msgstr ""
"Lisätietoja laskutuksesta on kohdassa :doc:`Laskuta toimitettujen tai "
"tilattujen määrien perusteella <../invoicing/invoicing_policy>`."

